[ti:Kudakh Harder]
[ar:The Ambitious Chicken]
[al:Ambitious Chicken 2: Kudakh Harder]
[00:16.20]Left the coop with the lights turned low,
[00:20.10]a borrowed car and a radio.
[00:24.00]Every sign says eat in, take away,
[00:27.90]not this chick, not today.
[00:39.50]Kudakh, kudakh, the road is long,
[00:43.40]the fryer's hot, but I am gone.
[00:47.30]No bun, no pita, no lavash,
[00:51.20]to co-co-cosmos, I'll be kudakh!
[00:55.10]Kudakh, kudakh, the road is long,
[00:59.00]to co-co-cosmos, I'll be kudakh!
